			&mdash; AutoTTL learns this automatically from how often your update script actually runs, and predicts each feed's next check to line up with it.
		</p>
		<p>
			FreshRSS hidden HTTP cache floor (SimplePie <code>cache_duration</code>):
			<?= $this->minTTL > 0 ? $this->getStats()->humanIntervalFromSeconds($this->minTTL) : 'not configured' ?>
